1. The proprietary core (LicenseRef-CrimsonNoir-Proprietary)

These directories and files are the proprietary core. They are copyright Julian Cassius Subban, all rights
reserved, under the terms in LICENSES/LicenseRef-CrimsonNoir-Proprietary.txt. No licence to them is granted by
this file, by the repository being readable, or by a release:

  crimson_noir_os/   the operating system: the bootable UEFI image, the hosted runtime, noir_core, the
                     shaders, the containment configuration and its proof harnesses
  src/               the page's runtime: the world, the rules, the agents, the hardware layer, the senses, the
                     decisions, the actions, the swarm, the cognition and the network
  native/            the native cores (the routing core, the KV pager and its WebAssembly module)
  world/             the compiled region pack and its previews
  index.html, vite.config.ts   the page's entry and its build

Headers: "Copyright (c) 2026 Julian Cassius Subban. All Rights Reserved." and
"SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-CrimsonNoir-Proprietary".


2. The open-source auxiliary tooling (MIT)

These directories and files are auxiliary tooling, open source under the MIT License (LICENSES/MIT.txt),
copyright Julian Cassius Subban:

  tools/             the build, verification, self-healing, world-compilation, network smoke and licence tools
  deploy/            the host's deployment: compose, nginx, the tunnel and the one-touch deploy script
  .github/           the workflows
  docs/              the design documents and audits
  Dockerfile, publish.ps1   the container build and the publish script

Headers: "Copyright (c) 2026 Julian Cassius Subban" and "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT".


