4. Third-party software

The build bundles third-party open-source software (React, three.js, Rapier, Tailwind CSS). Each
package remains under its own license, not under any licence above. NOTICE.md lists them; their full
license texts are embedded at the end of dist/index.html by the build. The bootable image links font8x8 (MIT) and
log (MIT OR Apache-2.0); crimson_noir_os/NOTICE.txt carries their notices.


